 "remarks": "Discover effortless living in this beautifully updated, move-in-ready residence, offering an inviting blend of style, comfort, and functionality. Soaring ceilings and an open-concept design create an airy, light-filled main level, seamlessly connecting the living and dining spaces with the kitchen. A dedicated laundry room with additional pantry storage adds everyday convenience. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite features vaulted ceilings and a private en-suite bath, complemented by an additional full bathroom. A versatile loft provides valuable flexibility, ideal for a home office, guest accommodations, or potential second bedroom. An outdoor deck offers the perfect setting to relax or entertain, while the rare convenience of a one-car garage further enhances the appeal with an additional assigned parking spot. Thoughtfully designed for comfortable, low-maintenance living, this residence presents an exceptional opportunity for both owner-occupants and investors seeking a desirable rental property.",
